00:27:20.960 --> 00:27:22.250
System that's available.

00:27:22.250 --> 00:27:24.110
If you're responsible
for managing,

00:27:24.110 --> 00:27:26.540
basically, your organization's
cloud resources, maybe you

00:27:26.540 --> 00:27:29.450
have lots of projects
with different app engine

00:27:29.450 --> 00:27:31.790
stuff in it, with different
billing accounts, storage

00:27:31.790 --> 00:27:34.730
buckets, et cetera,
trying to consolidate

00:27:34.730 --> 00:27:37.970
all of what you have and
manage that all can be actually

00:27:37.970 --> 00:27:39.475
kind of tricky and hard.

00:27:39.475 --> 00:27:40.850
So we've started
this whole thing

00:27:40.850 --> 00:27:42.433
called the Asset
Inventory System that

00:27:42.433 --> 00:27:44.990
provides an API that will
enable you to do that.

00:27:44.990 --> 00:27:46.520
If you actually
have a look, we'll

00:27:46.520 --> 00:27:49.340
put a link in our blog post,
but there's examples there

00:27:49.340 --> 00:27:50.540
of how you can hit the API.

00:27:50.540 --> 00:27:51.629
It is the first pass.

00:27:51.629 --> 00:27:53.420
There's going to be
some more stuff coming.

00:27:53.420 --> 00:27:54.920
So definitely
