00:28:10.050 --> 00:28:14.220
And so the Cloud KMS Vault users
can manage their cloud KMS keys

00:28:14.220 --> 00:28:17.210
now, encrypt and decrypt
data, and sign verified data

00:28:17.210 --> 00:28:19.310
using the familiar Vault API.

00:28:19.310 --> 00:28:21.230
